text = "The Locker Room is where you can tune your run from mediocre, to interstellar!

There are several stations in the locker room for you to inteact with on any visit that will give you some form of a benefit.

Each Visit you will have a base amount of energy to spend that is not carried over.

You can modify this amount several ways in the game, but you can find those for yourself!


Let's get into the stations:

*For the bait shop (See Bait)

*Offer Libations: Here you can spend 1 Energy to bank 2 Energy for your next visit!

*Styx Ice Bath: Double Attribute gain next game. (i.e. if your ending MachMultiplier is 3, instead of +3 all stats, you get +6!)

*The Showers: Permanently raise your attribute cap by 5

*The Wheel: Spin the wheel for great rewards, or devastating punishment!

*The Whiteboard: Scout your next opponent out and get ahead of the game!

*Bargain with the Abyss: The Ferryman will offer you a contract a grant a random stat boost in exchange for a curse, very similar to the bait shop.

*The Altar: Working on it now, i'll let you know what it does when it's ready!

*The Kibisis: Your locker! This is where your Extra threads are stored and can be swapped out at any time!

*Apollo's Chalk: Chalk up for the next game and hit your first, UnBlocked Shot, guaranteed!


That's the basics of the locker room. There will be plenty of fun interactions you'll find the more you play!

For now, you've got the basics covered. I'll see you in the showers ;)

"

